# Awesome References (Optional)

This folder is a local cache of curated `awesome-*` GitHub repositories. It exists to make technology discovery and best-practice lookup fast and searchable during planning.

## Layout

- `seeds.tsv`: curated seed list (what gets synced)
- `repos/`: local clones (ignored by git)

## Sync / Update

```bash
./references/awesome/sync.sh
```

Reproducibility:
- `./references/awesome/sync.sh` also writes `references/awesome/LOCK.json` (commit SHAs per repo).

## Search

```bash
rg -n "observability" references/awesome/repos
rg -n "threat model" references/awesome/repos
```
